OL,3,ALula wins fourth term in dramatic
OL,4,ABrazil election comeback
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlavio Bolsonaro, the son of convicted
OL,7,Fformer president Jair Bolsonaro, has so
OL,8,Ffar refused to recognise the result and
OL,9,Fcalled for it to be annulled. World
OL,10,Fleaders have congratulated Lula on his
OL,11,Fre-election.
